ed on 12 June 1309 at Soldin, present-day Myślibórz in Poland.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/pact-of-brunnen"><span class="enc-name">Pact of Brunnen</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · 1315</span><span class="enc-snip">The Pact of Brunnen was an alliance concluded on 9 December 1315 at Brunnen, on Lake Lucerne, by Uri, Schwyz and Unterwalden, weeks after their victory over the…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-noteborg"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/treaty-of-noteborg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Treaty of Nöteborg</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · Peace · 1323</span><span class="enc-snip">The Treaty of Nöteborg was a peace concluded in 1323 at the fortress of Nöteborg (Orekhovets) at the source of the Neva between Sweden and the Novgorod Republic.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-edinburgh-northampton"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/treaty-of-edinburgh-northampton.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Treaty of Edinburgh–Northampton</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · Peace · 1328</span><span class="enc-snip">The Treaty of Edinburgh–Northampton, agreed at Edinburgh in March 1328 and ratified by the English parliament at Northampton in May, ended the First War of Scottish…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-kalisz-1343"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/treaty-of-kalisz-1343.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Treaty of Kalisz (1343)</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · Peace · 1343</span><span class="enc-snip">The Treaty of Kalisz, concluded in July 1343, ended a long conflict between King Casimir III of Poland and the Teutonic Order.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-bolotovo"><s